there have been plenty of rumors and  leaks but thanks to a live stream we  finally got an official look at the next  destiny expansion rise of iron you can  expect the typical new areas and weapons  plus the return of a fan favorite and  you won't have to wait very long to play  it rise of iron releases September 20th  rise of iron adds two new areas the  plague lands and fell winter peak  destiny starting area the wall has also  been changed the expansion also includes  a new raid new and updated strikes new  patrols and new crucible maps the  maximum white level is increasing and a  new mutated enemy faction is being  introduced as for weapons the  fan-favorite dollar horn is making a  comeback anyone can earn it by  completing a certain mission but you can  get a special black and white silver  version of the gun by pre-ordering the  expansion you can also wield the new  flaming war axe which just sounds like  one of the coolest melee weapons ever  previous destiny expansions have come to  both old and current-gen consoles but  that's not the case this time around  rise of iron is coming exclusively to  ps4 and Xbox one and it'll cost you  thirty bucks additionally some items  will be exclusive to PlayStation players  for a limited time to keep up with all  the Destiny news keep it locked at  gamespot
 

